@rwasef1830 a workaround until we resolve this issue would be to use a [global.json file to pin to a 5.0 SDK](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/core/tools/global-json). 

e.g.

```json
{
  "sdk": {
    "version": "5.0.403" // Change this to a 5.0 SDK that you have installed.
  }
}
```
